    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459160/extras/d446bb140eaeffa3bc7ef60270f281e0.avif?t=1739918978\" data-has-big width=800 height=241 /></span><br><strong>Zombie Tower Defense</strong>: Defend, Survive, Conquer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The undead are rising, Commander! The neighborhood needs a hero\u2014will you step up?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your tactical genius as you deploy archers, bombers, electric shockers, and snipers to obliterate the zombie horde. Upgrade your arsenal, master 32 adrenaline-pumping levels, and stop the apocalypse in its tracks!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why You'll Love It:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 30 Action-Packed Levels: Every stage brings new challenges and thrills.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Effortless One-Touch Gameplay: Jump right into the action, no steep learning curve needed.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Immersive Experience: Stunning visuals and an electrifying soundtrack to keep you on edge.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of the neighborhood is in your hands. Can you rise to the challenge and stop the zombie invasion?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download now and start defending today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459160/extras/6de892a3e60230e4e092cc9a57dd83cc.avif?t=1739918978\" width=300 height=300 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459160/extras/d446bb140eaeffa3bc7ef60270f281e0.avif?t=1739918978\" data-has-big width=800 height=241 /></span><br><strong>Zombie Tower Defense</strong>: Defend, Survive, Conquer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The undead are rising, Commander! The neighborhood needs a hero\u2014will you step up?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your tactical genius as you deploy archers, bombers, electric shockers, and snipers to obliterate the zombie horde. Upgrade your arsenal, master 32 adrenaline-pumping levels, and stop the apocalypse in its tracks!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why You'll Love It:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 30 Action-Packed Levels: Every stage brings new challenges and thrills.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Effortless One-Touch Gameplay: Jump right into the action, no steep learning curve needed.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Immersive Experience: Stunning visuals and an electrifying soundtrack to keep you on edge.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of the neighborhood is in your hands. Can you rise to the challenge and stop the zombie invasion?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download now and start defending today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459160/extras/6de892a3e60230e4e092cc9a57dd83cc.avif?t=1739918978\" width=300 height=300 /></span></p>",
